{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a <strong>super-heavy tank</strong> alone through the remnants of a ruined world. Discover hidden secrets and face dangers at every turn. <i>You are protected by <strong>140 tons of steel</strong>, but will it be enough?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Tank</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/fa93ca2670b01bb682d88f940581cd56.poster.avif?t=1774633285\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/fa93ca2670b01bb682d88f940581cd56.webm?t=1774633285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/fa93ca2670b01bb682d88f940581cd56.mp4?t=1774633285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, return to your <strong>bunker</strong> to refuel, add oxygen, and enhance your tank\u2019s systems. Upgrade your machine to extend your reach into the <strong>unknown</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steel and Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/5228f6afabd6943c77728f8f9d950229.poster.avif?t=1774633285\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/5228f6afabd6943c77728f8f9d950229.webm?t=1774633285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/5228f6afabd6943c77728f8f9d950229.mp4?t=1774633285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage <strong>enemy tanks</strong> and <strong>alien creatures</strong> with your powerful <strong>128 mm</strong> cannon and a secondary <strong>75 mm</strong> gun. Every shot counts, and a single mistake can turn <i>triumph</i> into <i>ruin</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for the Next Expedition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/222ea1c00186faf9a1c5752b45c8301e.poster.avif?t=1774633285\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/222ea1c00186faf9a1c5752b45c8301e.webm?t=1774633285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/222ea1c00186faf9a1c5752b45c8301e.mp4?t=1774633285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your tank with <strong>additional modules</strong> to boost performance and handle new challenges. Adapt your machine and get ready for the <strong>dangers ahead</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personal Touch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/95637f27a269be927fb8c584534340fa.poster.avif?t=1774633285\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/95637f27a269be927fb8c584534340fa.webm?t=1774633285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/95637f27a269be927fb8c584534340fa.mp4?t=1774633285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate the inside of your <strong>E-100</strong> with small items to make it feel like <i>your</i> space. A familiar object can keep your morale steady out there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a tense, atmospheric world with lowpoly, stylized visuals. <strong><i>Breaking Armor</i></strong> combines horror, tactical tank combat, and the eerie uncertainty of a planet reshaped by <strong>catastrophe</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087530?t=1774633285","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/8b0383966fbb169ad8defb689219b6ed9422a4d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774633285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/ac1b6d9b9a016f0128c0277bf4ede461cdb86d9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774633285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/ac1b6d9b9a016f0128c0277bf4ede461cdb86d9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774633285","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a <strong>super-heavy tank</strong> alone through the remnants of a ruined world. Discover hidden secrets and face dangers at every turn. <i>You are protected by <strong>140 tons of steel</strong>, but will it be enough?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Tank</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/fa93ca2670b01bb682d88f940581cd56.poster.avif